    "/api/getBasicResources": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "任务管理下拉框+事实问题下拉框+专家列表",
        "description": "输入样例：\n\n```\n1、查询值列表（注：获取全部的电厂、专家时，无需传codeType，其他的都需要传codeType，具体codeType请参考[http://conf.cnnp.com.cn/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=44437728](http://conf.cnnp.com.cn/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=44437728)）\n\n{\n  \"codeTypeList\": [\n    \"inspect_method\",\n    \"fact_category\"\n  ],  \"resourcesType\": \"staticCode\"\n}\n\n2、查询筛选下拉框\n\n{\n  \"year\": 2025,\n  \"expertId\": \"t_zhongkai1\",\n  \"resourcesType\": \"filterOption\"\n}\n```\n\n输出样例\n\n```\n1、查询值列表\n\n\n{\n  \"getStaticCodeListVo\": {\n    \"inspectorList\": [\n      {\n        \"certCode\": \"360782199303150037\",\n        \"email\": \"t_zhongkai@cnnp.com.cn\",\n        \"phone\": \"18575503315\",\n        \"sex\": \"1\",\n        \"userCode\": \"80283102\",\n        \"userName\": \"钟锴\"\n      },      {\n        \"certCode\": \"140203199703080433\",\n        \"email\": \"t_liangyue01@cnnp.com.cn\",\n        \"phone\": \"13641927040\",\n        \"sex\": \"1\",\n        \"userCode\": \"80294867\",\n        \"userName\": \"梁越\"\n      },      {\n        \"certCode\": \"412728199908212825\",\n        \"email\": \"t_dongjr@cnnp.com.cn\",\n        \"phone\": \"13137910705\",\n        \"sex\": \"2\",\n        \"userCode\": \"80292922\",\n        \"userName\": \"董静茹\"\n      }    ],\n    <span class=\"colour\" style=\"color: rgb(163, 21, 21);\">\"powerInfoList\"</span><span class=\"colour\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: [</span>\n{\n\"id\": 1,\n\"powerId\": \"QS\",\n\"powerName\": \"秦山核电\"\n},\n{\n\"id\": 2,\n\"powerId\": \"XP\",\n\"powerName\": \"霞浦核电\"\n}\n],\n    \"staticCodeMappings\": {\n      \"fact_category\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": 456,\n          \"isDefault\": 1,\n          \"itemCode\": \"PROGRAM_INSUFFICENT\",\n          \"itemName\": \"程序知道执行不足\",\n          \"parentId\": 0,\n          \"sort\": 1,\n          \"typeId\": 127\n        },        {\n          \"id\": 457,\n          \"isDefault\": 1,\n          \"itemCode\": \"PROGRAM_QUALITY_PROBLEM\",\n          \"itemName\": \"程序制度质量问题\",\n          \"parentId\": 0,\n          \"sort\": 2,\n          \"typeId\": 127\n        },        {\n          \"id\": 458,\n          \"isDefault\": 1,\n          \"itemCode\": \"PROGRAM_UN_CONSTRAINT\",\n          \"itemName\": \"程序制度未满足上游规范标准\",\n          \"parentId\": 0,\n          \"sort\": 3,\n          \"typeId\": 127\n        },        {\n          \"id\": 459,\n          \"isDefault\": 1,\n          \"itemCode\": \"MANUAL_OPERATION_ERROR\",\n          \"itemName\": \"人员行为偏差\",\n          \"parentId\": 0,\n          \"sort\": 4,\n          \"typeId\": 127\n        },        {\n          \"id\": 460,\n          \"isDefault\": 1,\n          \"itemCode\": \"DESIGN_DEFECTS\",\n          \"itemName\": \"设计缺陷\",\n          \"parentId\": 0,\n          \"sort\": 5,\n          \"typeId\": 127\n        },        {\n          \"id\": 461,\n          \"isDefault\": 1,\n          \"itemCode\": \"UN_TIME_PROCESSED\",\n          \"itemName\": \"未及时消缺\",\n          \"parentId\": 0,\n          \"sort\": 6,\n          \"typeId\": 127\n        }      ],\n      \"inspect_method\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": 452,\n          \"isDefault\": 1,\n          \"itemCode\": \"STAFF_INTERVIEW\",\n          \"itemName\": \"人员访谈\",\n          \"parentId\": 0,\n          \"sort\": 1,\n          \"typeId\": 126\n        },        {\n          \"id\": 453,\n          \"isDefault\": 1,\n          \"itemCode\": \"ACTIVITY_OBSERVATION\",\n          \"itemName\": \"活动观察\",\n          \"parentId\": 0,\n          \"sort\": 2,\n          \"typeId\": 126\n        },        {\n          \"id\": 454,\n          \"isDefault\": 1,\n          \"itemCode\": \"SITE_INSPECTION\",\n          \"itemName\": \"现场巡视\",\n          \"parentId\": 0,\n          \"sort\": 3,\n          \"typeId\": 126\n        },        {\n          \"id\": 455,\n          \"isDefault\": 1,\n          \"itemCode\": \"DOCUMENT_REVIEW\",\n          \"itemName\": \"文件查阅\",\n          \"parentId\": 0,\n          \"sort\": 4,\n          \"typeId\": 126\n        }      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"responseStatus\": {\n    \"ack\": \"Success\",\n    \"code\": \"200\",\n    \"timestamp\": 1755760426013\n  }\n}\n2、查询筛选下拉框\n\n{\n  \"getFilterOptionVo\": {\n    \"domainsMapping\": [\n      {\n        \"key\": \"HXGL\",\n        \"keyValueList\": [\n          {\n            \"key\": \"SM\",\n            \"value\": \"2#电厂\"\n          },          {\n            \"key\": \"QS\",\n            \"value\": \"1#电厂\"\n          }        ],\n        \"value\": \"化学管理\"\n      },      {\n        \"key\": \"HXGL1\",\n        \"keyValueList\": [\n          {\n            \"key\": \"SM\",\n            \"value\": \"2#电厂\"\n          },          {\n            \"key\": \"QS\",\n            \"value\": \"1#电厂\"\n          }        ],\n        \"value\": \"化学管理1\"\n      }    ],\n    \"powerPlantKeyMapping\": [\n      {\n        \"key\": \"SM\",\n        \"keyValueList\": [\n          {\n            \"key\": \"HXGL1\",\n            \"value\": \"化学管理1\"\n          },          {\n            \"key\": \"HXGL\",\n            \"value\": \"化学管理\"\n          }        ],\n        \"value\": \"2#电厂\"\n      },      {\n        \"key\": \"QS\",\n        \"keyValueList\": [\n          {\n            \"key\": \"HXGL1\",\n            \"value\": \"化学管理1\"\n          },          {\n            \"key\": \"HXGL\",\n            \"value\": \"化学管理\"\n          }        ],\n        \"value\": \"1#电厂\"\n      }    ]\n  },\n  \"responseStatus\": {\n    \"ack\": \"Success\",\n    \"code\": \"200\",\n    \"timestamp\": 1755674260754\n  }\n}\n```",
        "tags": [
          "公共分类"
        ],
